  m_text: "<b>Season:</b> Winter (October\u2013December)\n<b>Path:</b> The Asian
    landmass cools down more rapidly than the ocean while the ocean remains warmer
    with relatively lower pressure. This causes the winds to blow in the opposite
    direction from the land towards the ocean bringing dry conditions to much of
    Asia.\nIndian landmass \u2192 Bay of Bengal \u2192 Indian Ocean\n<b>Examples:</b>
    Tamil Nadu, parts of Andhra Pradesh."
